'''Morty''' (Japanese: '''マツバ''' ''Matsuba'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=For each of your {{e|Psychic}} Pokémon in play, look at that many cards from the top of your opponent's deck and put them back in any order.
}}

