==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Morty}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Morty]] is a [[Gym Leader]] in {{game5|Gold|Silver|Crystal|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}, with his design based on his appearance in the latter two games.
*The uncommon illustration depicts the [[Ecruteak Gym]], which Morty leads.
*This card's effect may be a reference to the fact that Morty is known as "The Mystic Seer of the Future".

